Part 6 – Debugging Exercises
Debugging 1

SELECT *
FROM students
WHERE age => 22;


Identify and fix the mistake.
Debugging 2

SELECT *
FROM students
WHERE city = 'Delhi'
AND OR age > 22;


Identify and fix the syntax mistake.
Debugging 3

SELECT *
FROM students
ORDER BY fees DESC
LIMIT -5;


Identify the issue and write the correct query for retrieving the top 5 expensive students.
